  "description": "After losing her divine powers, a once-revered saintess is treated as nothing more than an empty shell. One day, an imperial prince who also serves as the commander of the knights approaches her for confession. He reveals that he has committed three terrible sins, beginning with drugging and sexually assaulting a woman he secretly loves while she was unconscious. As he asks for forgiveness, the saintess struggles to remain calm, sensing an unsettling danger in his words. But as his forbidden confession continues, the horrifying truth unfolds in ways she could never have imagined.\nSource: MU",
